- [N1] Omitted trace (input 0): i1:To start, go to the Amazon homepage. -> i2:After that, search for a book. -> i3:Once you've found the book, click on the link that says "22 used" to see the used books available. -> i4:From there, click on the "Add to Cart" button for the second book on the list. -> i5:After adding it to your cart, click on the "Proceed to Checkout" button. -> i6:On the checkout page, enter your email address and select the option that says "I am a new customer". -> i7:Next, click on the "Sign in using our secure server" button. -> i8:Once you've signed in, enter your customer details and click on the "Create account" button. -> i9:After creating your account, enter your shipping details and click on the "Continue" button. -> i10:On the next page, select your preferred shipping options and click on "Continue" again. -> i11:Then, choose your payment method and enter your credit card details. -> i12:Click on the "Add your card" button to save your card information. -> i13:After that, click on "Continue" to proceed. -> i14:Next, choose your billing address and select the option to use the address you've chosen. -> i15:Finally, click on "Place your order in AUD" to complete the process.

